<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>vaemptîness</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cardo:ital,wght@0,400;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html, body {
      height: 100%;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f0e8;
      color: #111111;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 2rem;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .peace-wrapper {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 540px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-family: 'Cardo', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #111111;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .brand-va {
      color: #b85c4f;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 40px;
      height: 1px;
      background: #b85c4f;
      margin: 0 auto 3rem;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .peace-message {
      font-family: 'Cardo', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #111111;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .peace-sub {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 300;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #8a7968;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="peace-wrapper">
    <p class="brand"><span class="brand-va">va</span>emptîness</p>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p class="peace-message">
      Hay un espacio entre el estímulo y la respuesta.<br>
      En ese espacio reside la paz.
    </p>
    <p class="peace-sub">Volvemos pronto</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
